sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Host (vision + logs)
  participant E as ESP32-C3 bridge
  participant U as Uno controller
  H->>E: SET_PITCH=5.000 ... SET_TURNS=7
  E->>U: (forwarded line by line)
  U-->>H: OK=SET_PITCH ...
  H->>U: START
  U-->>H: STATE=HOME, HOME_ERROR_MM=0.00, STATE=PRETENSION
  loop every 500 ms while winding/verifying
    H->>U: HEARTBEAT
  end
  U-->>H: STATE=WIND, TURN=1 ... TURN=8
  U-->>H: EVENT=WIND_DONE, STATE=VERIFY
  H->>H: capture + deterministic QA
  alt coil accepted
    H->>U: LENGTH_MM=35.38, VISION_OK
    U-->>H: STATE=COMPLETE, COMPLETE turns=8 lin_steps=16000 ...
  else defect / camera fault / host silent
    H->>U: FAULT_GAP (or no HEARTBEAT for 3 s)
    U-->>H: FAULT=VISION_GAP, STATE=SAFE_STOP
  end
